SCIENTIFIC DISCLAIMER

Nothing produced by this software has been experimentally validated. Its outputs are
prioritised, falsified hypotheses with stated confidence, intended to inform experimental
planning. They are not evidence of a protein-ligand interaction, and they must not be used
as a basis for any clinical or diagnostic decision.
